oJ?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 230, "status": 200, "title": "Intron retention regulates STAT2 function and associates with immunotherapy response in lung cancer", "unwound_url": "https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/science.aea7156", "url": "https://t.co/MPCDryeOVo"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/StNxgikzDo", "end": 277, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2113702282588192784/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113701950558789632", "start": 254, "url": "https://t.co/StNxgikzDo"}]}, "id": "2113702282588192784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 46, "impression_count": 22953, "like_count": 100, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 28}, "text": "We didn't know about the role of alternative RNA splicing for response to cancer immunotherapy. Discovery of STAT2 introns that influence non-small cell lung cancer response and survival (PSI=percent spliced in) @ScienceMagazine \nhttps://t.co/MPCDryeOVo https://t.co/StNxgikzDo", "url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2113702282588192784"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113700838292004864"]}, "author_id": "31586578", "created_at": "2026-10-23T18:35:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113700875013435892"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Stephen Wolfram explains the concept of ruliobiology, a metamodel of biology. Explore the interplay of natural selection, adaptive evolution and computational irreducibility.", "display_url": "writings.stephenwolfram.com/2026/10/endles…", "end": 240, "expanded_url": "https://writings.stephenwolfram.com/2026/10/endless-forms-most-beautiful-and-most-wonderful-ruliobiology-and-the-theoretical-foundations-of-biological-form/", "images": [{"height": 546, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113700881732694016/tNsb2nvb?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1272}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113700881732694016/tNsb2nvb?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 217, "status": 200, "title": "“Endless Forms Most B